# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ONE repo for D:\AKHIL\HP. It tracks:
#     CLAUDE.md                the auto-loaded session brief
#     context/                 the durable brain
#     projects/gamepados/      the GamepadOS product source
#
# It is a WHITELIST — everything is ignored by default and only the paths
# below are re-included. That is deliberate: keys/, every .env, and
# release.keystore live under this folder, and a stray `git add -A` must
# never be able to reach them.
#
# Deliberately NOT tracked here (they have their own remotes):
#     projects/gamepados/website/   -> gamepadadmin01-tech/gamepad
#     projects/gamepados-account/   -> gamepadadmin01-tech/app-with-login
#     projects/flexsquares/         -> gamepadadmin01-tech/flexspace
#
# Deliberately NOT tracked at all:
#     keys/  toolchain/  media/  installers/  _TO_DELETE_*/  .agents/
#     projects/daily-news-app/  projects/spotify-corizo/
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Ignore everything at the root...
/*

# ...then re-include only these.
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/context/
!/projects/

# Inside projects/, only gamepados is tracked.
/projects/*
!/projects/gamepados/

# projects/gamepados/.gitignore governs everything below it — it excludes
# website/, tools/, node_modules/, target/, .cargo/, releases/, secrets and
# large binaries.

# Belt and braces: never let a secret through, wherever it appears.
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/local.properties
**/secrets/
